---
title: "Stone Town Walking Tour"
description: "Walk Zanzibar's UNESCO World Heritage Stone Town with a licensed local guide, exploring carved doors, markets and 200 years of Swahili history."
permalink: "/tours/stone-town-walking-tour/"
tour_slug: "stone-town-walking-tour"
---
{% include "seo.njk" %}
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main class="" id="main-content">
  <section class="tour-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dct-ocean) 0%, var(--dct-palm) 100%);">
    <div class="tour-hero-content">
      {% set featured = page.inputPath | featuredImage %}
{% set cdnSrc = page.inputPath | cdnImage %}
<img src="{{ cdnSrc }}" alt="{{ featured.featuredAlt or page.title }}" class="tour-hero-image" loading="lazy">

      <span class="card-badge badge-cultural">CUL — Cultural Tour</span>
      <h1>Stone Town walking tour</h1>
      <p class="tour-meta">2–4 hours · Stone Town</p>
<div class="tour-price-box">
        <span class="price-label">From</span>
        <span class="price-amount">{% catPrice "stone-town-walking-tour" %}</span>
        <span class="price-note">per person</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Stone Town Walking Tour Pricing Table -->
      <div class="pricing-table">
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;">Stone Town Walking Tour — Per-Person Rates</h2>
        <div class="table-wrapper">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Configuration</th>
                <th>Per-person rate</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Group walking tour</td>
                <td>$35 pp</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Private 2 guests (incl. transport)</td>
                <td>$90 pp ($180 total)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <p class="table-note">Group rate is guided walk only, starting/ending at Forodhani Gardens. Private rate includes licensed guide, complimentary bottled water, and hotel/port pickup/drop-off. Entry fees to museums ($5–10 per person) are payable separately at the venue.</p>
        </div>

      <button type="button" data-sns-booking-open data-service-slug="{{ tour_slug }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Check price & book</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% include "tour-booking-panel.njk" %}

  <div class="tour-grid">
    <div class="tour-main">
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>Walk through the heart of Zanzibar's UNESCO World Heritage site with a licensed local guide. Discover 200 years of history — from the Sultan's palace to the bustling market scene, the House of Wonders, and the Old Fort.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>What to Expect</h2>
        <ul class="expect-list">
      <li>2–4 hour guided walk led by a Zanzibar-licensed guide</li>
      <li>Visit Forodhani Gardens night market (if evening)</li>
      <li>Explore the Old Fort, House of Wonders, and Sultan's Palace Museum</li>
      <li>Browse the Darajani and Forodhani markets</li>
      <li>Stroll the seafront promenade and the Old City gates</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Tour Highlights in Pictures</h2>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'stone-town-temple-street-view-zanzibar.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'stone-town-temple-street-view-zanzibar.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Heritage &amp; Architecture</span>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'stone-town-alley-woman-walking.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'stone-town-alley-woman-walking.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Carved Teak Doors</span>
          </div>
          <div style="border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
            <img src="{{ 'zanzibar-stone-town-market-fruit-stall.jpg' | cdnFile }}" alt="{{ 'zanzibar-stone-town-market-fruit-stall.jpg' | canonicalAlt }}" style="width: 100%; height: 160px; object-fit: cover;" loading="lazy">
            <span style="display: block; padding: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #4e5d66; background: #fdfaf5; text-align: center;">Darajani Spice Market</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Duration & Meeting Point</h2>
        <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 2–4 hours (customizable: morning or late afternoon)</p>
        <p><strong>Meeting point:</strong> Forodhani Gardens, Stone Town waterfront</p>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Important Notes</h2>
        <ul class="notes-list">
      <li>Entry fees to museums are not included — budget $5–10 extra</li>
      <li>Wear comfortable walking shoes; Stone Town has uneven surfaces</li>
      <li>Bring a hat and water; midday sun is intense</li>
      <li>Licensed guides charge per group, not per person — perfect for families</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Inclusions</h2>
        <ul class="includes-list">
      <li>Licensed Zanzibar tour guide</li>
      <li>Complimentary bottled drinking water</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      {% include "tour-reviews.njk" %}

      <section class="tour-section">
        <h2>Physical Demand & Requirements</h2>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #00667c;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">💪 Physical Demand: Low-Moderate</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">2–4 hours walking on uneven historic streets; some stairs and narrow alleys. Suitable for most fitness levels.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">👶 Age Guidelines</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">All ages; children under 6 free</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;border-left:4px solid #9c27b0;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">👥 Group Size</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Private: 1–10; Group tour: max 12</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;background:#f0f9ff;border-left:4px solid #00667c;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;">☁️ Weather Policy</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Runs rain or shine; bring umbrella/hat. Severe weather may reschedule.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem;">
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">🎒 What to Bring</h3>
            <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.25rem;line-height:1.8;">
              <li>Comfortable walking shoes</li>
              <li>Hat & sunscreen</li>
              <li>Water bottle</li>
              <li>Camera</li>
              <li>Cash for museum entry ($5–10)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">📍 Meeting Point</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Forodhani Gardens, Stone Town waterfront (or hotel pickup)</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0;">⏱️ Duration</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">2–4 hours</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card reveal" style="padding:1.5rem;background:#fff3e0;border-left:4px solid #ff9800;">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0;">⚠️ Cancellation & Booking Policy</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;line-height:1.7;">Free cancellation up to 24 hours before. No deposit required.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      
      {% include "tour-faq.njk" %}
    </div>

    <aside class="tour-sidebar">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>📍 Tour Details</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><span class="label">Duration:</span><span class="value">2–4 hours (customizable: morning or late afternoon)</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Location:</span><span class="value">Stone Town</span></li>
          <li><span class="label">Category:</span><span class="value">{{ 'CUL' | attractionTypeLabel }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="booking-card">
          <div class="price">{% catPrice tour_slug %} <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; opacity: 0.85;">/ person</span></div>
          <h3>Ready to Book?</h3>
          <p style="opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">Send us your preferred date and group size on WhatsApp. We'll confirm with a fixed price including all fees.</p>
          <a href="https://wa.me/{{ site.contact.whatsapp }}?text=Jambo%20Spice%20%26%20Sail%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20book%20{{ title | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-accent btn-lg">WhatsApp: {{ site.contact.whatsapp_display }}</a>
          <p class="note">✓ Verified published rate • Marine conservation fees included • Zero booking deposit</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
  {% include "tour-mobile-sticky.njk" %}
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
